OL,3,AKuwait says it repelled first Iranian
OL,4,Aattack in two months after US strikes
OL,5,Aisland
OL,6,
OL,7,FKuwait and Bahrain have said they
OL,8,Frepelled Iranian air attacks overnight
OL,9,Fas hostilities between Iran and the
OL,10,FUnited States rise.
OL,12,FThe drone attack on Kuwait was the
OL,13,Ffirst in more than two months. The
OL,14,FIranian army said it had targeted the
OL,15,FAli Al Salem Airbase, which hosts US
OL,16,Fforces, but Kuwaiti authorities did not
OL,17,Freport any damage.
OL,19,FIt came after US warplanes struck an
OL,20,FIranian missile launch site on Qeshm
OL,21,FIsland in the Strait of Hormuz,
OL,22,Faccording to US military officials.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
