OL,5,Aisland
OL,6,
OL,7,FMeanwhile, the United Arab Emirates'
OL,8,Fstate oil firm said a crew member was
OL,9,Fmissing after one of its tankers was
OL,10,Fattacked in the Gulf waterway on
OL,11,FTuesday.
